  "text": "Skip to content\nSoren Hale\n01\nWork\n02\nServices\n03\nAbout\n04\nLab\n05\nWriting\nOpen to work from November\nGet in touch\n\n// The small print\n\nPrivacy policy. \n\nLast updated October 1, 2026\n\nThis page explains what this website collects and why. It is sample text: replace it with your own policy before you publish.\n\nWhat I collect\nYour name, email and message when you send the contact form\nThe picks you make on the project brief (kind and budget), so the contact form can show them\nAnonymous visit numbers, if analytics are switched on in the site settings\nWhat I use it for\n\nTo reply to you and to plan the work you asked about. I do not sell personal data and I do not pass it to anyone who is not working on your project.\n\nHow long I keep it\n\nMessages are kept for as long as the conversation needs, and for the length of a project if one follows. You can ask me to delete them at any time.\n\nYour choices\n\nYou can ask for a copy of your data, ask me to correct it or ask me to delete it. Write to the email address at the bottom of this page and I will answer within a week.\n\nOther services\n\nThe links to code hosts and social profiles lead to services with their own policies. This page does not cover them.\n\nOn this page\n\n01\nWhat I collect\n02\nWhat I use it for\n03\nHow long I keep it\n04\nYour choices\n05\nOther services\n\nOther documents\n\nPrivacy\nTerms\nCookies\n\nA question about this page? Write to me\n\nFooter\n\nFrontend developer, Oslo\n\nWrite to me\nhello@sorenhale.dev\n\nOpen to work from November\n\n// Site\n\nWork\nServices\nProcess\nReviews\nContact\n\n// About\n\nAbout\nResume\nStack\nUses\nNow\n\n// More\n\nLab\nWriting\nFAQ\nPrivacy\nTerms\nCookies\n\n// Elsewhere\n\nGitHub\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nLinkedIn\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nBluesky\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\n\nLocal time, Oslo\n--:--\n\n© 2026 Soren Hale. Written by hand in Oslo.\n\nSorenHale\n\nCreate a free website with Framer, the website builder